Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["FreezeEncoderDepth", "ObjectName",
 CellID->564758943,ExpressionUUID->"1e08cc8b-1f62-d147-a682-0d5ed78d38c5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"9f6de87e-bedb-7c46-9e7d-2d743735aba3"],
 Cell[BoxData[
 "FreezeEncoderDepth"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "d7b1f999-9dbf-0649-9dc3-36bc779bc3e1"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for TrainSegmentationNetwork. If set to an \
integer n, freezes the first n encoder blocks of a pretrained input network \
so their weights are not updated during training, useful for transfer \
learning from a pretrained encoder. Only applies when netCont is not \
\"Start\". Default is None, which trains all layers."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->2190194,ExpressionUUID->"9eb9c974-4404-3443-a532-c52cacb62d68"],

